    "metadata":  {
        "purpose":  "Simulation 8.06 humid-air split-stage migration using the Thomson valve plus 2.5 m straight-hose geometry. This simulation is the 2-species dry-air, humid-air simulation for comparison with the single species simulation",
        "migrated_from_config":  "configs/sim-8-06_config.json",
        "legacy_meshing_script":  "PyFluent/Meshing/Thomsonvalve_Sim-8-01-meshing.py",
        "legacy_solver_script":  "PyFluent/Thompson_sim-2_code/Thomsonvalve_Sim-8-06-solver.py",
        "legacy_export_script":  "PyFluent/Poastprocessing/Thomsonvalve_Sim-8-06-results-export6.py",
        "legacy_plotting_script":  "PyFluent/Poastprocessing/Thomsonvalve_Sim-8-06-results-plotting2.1.py",
        "scientific_review_required":  true,
        "known_migration_differences":  [
            "The DPM injection, particle-track animation, and trajectory-sampling blocks in the legacy base 8.06 solver are triple-quoted and inactive; DPM remains disabled, but this config adds a carrier-flow velocity scene and timestep animation.",
            "The legacy resume script named by the config is missing, and its checkpoint data used a non-HDF .dat extension; this config starts from the mesh rather than the 400-step checkpoint.",
            "The humid-air mixture explicitly contains water-vapor and dry-air, with dry-air as the dependent last species. The inlet and initialized domain use water-vapor=0.0072 and dry-air=0.9928 by difference.",
            "The legacy cs_z_2460mm solver plane was accidentally placed at 2.260 m. This config uses the 2.460 m position defined by the shared export6 script.",
            "The legacy station report-definition file, area-weighted-average tables, plane audit, mass-flow summary, and full plotting suite are not generated by the current generic stages."
        ]
    },
